        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_12-2.lnote.oe.h" n="h" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">558</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">borhb. <hi rend="italic">ändert Schmid</hi> 540 <hi rend="italic">gemäss</hi> 10, 1<hi rend="italic">p</hi>; <hi rend="italic">II Cn.</hi> 58. <hi rend="italic">Doch könnte IV Atr.</hi> 4, 1 burhbrece V li. <hi rend="italic">vorschweben</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">borhb. altered by Schmid 540 in accordance with 10, 1p; II Cn. 58. But IV Atr. 4, 1 burhbrece V li. may have been in the author's mind</seg></note>
